      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> a dead battery in a controller makes it unusable\n\nIf one of my Oculus Touch or Index controllers disconnects due to an empty battery, the quick menu already becomes a one-handed menu. If you tap the quick menu button on the controller, the quick menu will open as a static menu in front of you and not be attached to your hand.",
      "viewerReactions": null
